Still, Copyright (c) 2026 Carbon (carbongotfound). Released under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later.
Where Still's files say "Carbon" as the copyright holder, that is Still's author.

Changes made for Carbon (2026):
- Renamed from Still to Carbon (names, folders, app id, installer, update source); new app icon.
- Carbon AI: a free built-in AI served by Carbon's own server (server/worker.js, carbon/Agents/CarbonAi.cs);
  a quick look at the active tab with each message; know-how for typing, documents, schoolwork and common sites;
  Word (.docx) and web page (.html) files from save_file (carbon/DocMaker.cs).
- Signal Run, the offline page's game (carbon/Assets/offline-game.js), and error pages in Carbon's look.
- The ad blocker reads EasyList, EasyPrivacy and Peter Lowe's list, and skips YouTube ads (carbon/AdBlock.cs).
- Color themes, new tab backgrounds and widgets, the extensions page, interaction effects (carbon-ui/src/theme.ts,
  Widgets.tsx, LookSettings.tsx, interact.ts, carbon-theme.css, BrowserTools.tsx).
- Save page for offline (carbon/MainWindow.Offline.cs).

Carbon's themes, new tab widgets and backgrounds, and website saver are adapted from Bullet,
https://github.com/K-I-X/Bullet-Browser (GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later).

Downloaded while Carbon runs, not shipped with it:
- EasyList and EasyPrivacy (https://easylist.to, GPL-3.0 or CC BY-SA 3.0) and Peter Lowe's ad server list
  (https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers), under their own terms.

Everything else Carbon uses is listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and the Licenses folder.
